            "review_title": "Review at Le Petit Chef - Saigon",
            "review_text": "HappyTravellerHK\nHong Kong Island, China73 contributions\n1\nSet menu offering an audio\nFeb 2020\nSet menu offering an audio visual experience with your dining. Animation is projected onto your table and plate. Theme is Silk Road with food from France, Middle East, India and China. Food was not so creative but good. A different experience with your dining. Table is shared with others. A bit expensive for what you get.\nWritten February 29, 2020",
